displayText = ["PROF 1: ...is doing splendidly. They'll make an incredible angel.",
			   "PROF 2: One of our best in a few millennia, I'd say. Truly the archetype of selfless righteousness.",
			   "PROF 2: Shame that they'll be separated from their twin. They got along so remarkably well.",
			   "PROF 1: No matter, that dark-haired one has such a selfish soul; they could hardly be sent up to heaven.",
			   "PROF 2: You're right. They won't remember each other anyway."];

